{% call s.prose({ width: "narrow" }) %}
  <p>Here's the promise underneath all of it, said plainly: you will never be treated like an appointment being processed. Not on the phone, not in the room, not on the way out the door. The moment this place starts to feel like a machine that turns people into billing codes is the moment it has lost the only thing that made it worth building. We would rather stay small and stay real.</p>
{% endcall %}
